"""
djinn-model-fetch — Download, analyze, render, and stage a 3D model for printing.

Flow:
  1. Download STL/3MF from URL
  2. Mesh analysis (dimensions, overhangs, bed fit)
  3. Generate renders (final product view + overhang map)
  4. Send question message with renders — asks supports/infill/brim
  5. Add to queue with status "needs_settings"

  User then replies: slice N supports=yes infill=15 brim=no
  → djinn-model-slice handles slicing + final report + confirm flow
"""

